    (F:Fiber M H Label Slot U a ε tstar T allowance i)
    (hprofile:∀s x,F.profile s x=S.W x)(hupper:∀s,F.upper s=2)
    (η:Character)(Q:Ideal O)(selected:Finset Slot)
