    (Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hZ _) (Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hZ _) hZ
  dsimp only at hh
  rw [iv_remainder_source_w_scale_identity J ell hell Z a e hZ,iv_remainder_source_z_scale_identity J ell hell Z a hZ] at hh
