        detectorMaximum (sourceDetectorFamily S hS.prime η u (rayCubeFamily M H hH u)) (3*(idx u+1:ℕ)*Z^τ)< a+2*e ∧
        (51/100< a → ∃j s,LFunction (sourceDetectorFamily S hS.prime η u (rayCubeFamily M H hH u) j) s=0 ∧
