      (D+Cp)*(Z^(HeckeZeroSupremum.beta-((4+RHIVProbe.b)/6)-1/3000+nu)+Z^(HeckeZeroSupremum.beta-((4+RHIVProbe.b)/6)+e-(RHIVProbe.boundary)*ellMin)) := by
