theorem source_batch_inverse_fields {Δ:ℝ}{D:RHZeroFreeExtension.AnalyticHigh.IV.HighData Δ}
    (S:RHZeroFreeExtension.AnalyticHigh.IV.SourceData D)(counts:IVRawCountParameters M H D.t):
