        (if 2*a-1≤5/6 then counts.kB else counts.kH) (C*(1+height)^J) ∧
      RawMoment F.rowData (scaleProfile W) (if 2*a-1≤5/6 then counts.cB else counts.cH)
        (if 2*a-1≤5/6 then counts.kB else counts.kH) (C*(1+height)^J)) ∧
